[PrintTextModified Text:总之得先从调查现场开始。<br>艾玛首先调查了一下审判庭内发现尸体的现场。|#0104Adv09_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……亚里沙……）|#0104Adv09_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女被捆绑在椅子上，无力地垂着脑袋。<br>那个模样实在过于凄惨。|#0104Adv09_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以平常的心态根本不忍直视，<br>但为了找出证据和线索，艾玛唯有狠下心来。|#0104Adv09_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆泣き声まじり

[PrintTextModified Text:有人对亚里沙小姐进行了处刑吗……|#0104Adv09_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哭红了眼睛的梅露露<br>跌跌撞撞地来到艾玛身边。|#0104Adv09_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来她已经调整好了心情，打算帮助艾玛调查。|#0104Adv09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（处刑……最让人在意的还是这一点）|#0104Adv09_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个是电椅，对吧。<br>用来执行电刑，令犯人触电致死。|#0104Adv09_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:应、应该没错……<br>椅背上也有按钮……|#0104Adv09_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如梅露露所说，<br>椅背上设置有一个按钮。|#0104Adv09_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然不清楚具体是什么构造，<br>但应该是按一下就会通电的那种。|#0104Adv09_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙的头发和衣服都是湿的……|#0104Adv09_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是为什么……？）|#0104Adv09_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以我们的条件<br>没法查明亚里沙的死因。|#0104Adv09_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，电椅触电应该就是她的死因吧……|#0104Adv09_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『電気椅子』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-2
@UpdateWitchBook Id:4-2 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，你看……！|#0104Adv09_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露正指着一道<br>留在亚里沙脸上的痕迹。<br>艾玛吞了吞口水。|#0104Adv09_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这……是灼伤？|#0104Adv09_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且……看样子她的魔女化程度已经很深了。|#0104Adv09_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙的外表可以说已经面目全非，<br>完全不像普通人类了。|#0104Adv09_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（简直……就像残骸一样）|#0104Adv09_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『アリサの死体写真』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-9
@UpdateWitchBook Id:4-9 Category:Clue Version:1
@Wait WaitMode:i1.5
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue Wait:true LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:在调查处刑台的地板时，<br>艾玛还发现了一件事。|#0104Adv09_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以尸体的双脚为中心，<br>附近一大片的地面上都散落着玻璃碎片状的东西。|#0104Adv09_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『ガラスの破片』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-5
@UpdateWitchBook Id:4-5 Category:Clue Version:1
@Wait WaitMode:i1.5
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue Wait:true LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:（这到底是什么东西……？）|#0104Adv09_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这看起来不像是电椅上的玻璃装饰或零件，<br>更像是从别的什么地方拿过来的。|#0104Adv09_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，再怎么想也无法当场得出答案。<br>艾玛把憋在胸口的闷气都吐了出来。|#0104Adv09_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着她往下移动视线，然后，在亚里沙的脚边发现了<br>一片混在玻璃碎片里的透明碎片。|#0104Adv09_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这……是蜡……吗？|#0104Adv09_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊，这个是……<br>用过的蜡烛残片……吧？|#0104Adv09_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……是亚里沙用过的东西吗？）|#0104Adv09_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『ロウソク』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-1
@UpdateWitchBook Id:4-1 Category:Clue Version:1
@Wait WaitMode:i1.5
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue Wait:true LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:"（亚里沙的周围<br>　我都已经看了一遍）|#0104Adv09_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（为什么<br>　亚里沙会在处刑台……？）|#0104Adv09_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『処刑台』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-8
@UpdateWitchBook Id:4-8 Category:Clue Version:1
@Wait WaitMode:i1.5
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue Wait:true LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛对处刑台的底座部分有些在意，<br>于是用手机拍了一张照片。|#0104Adv09_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……至今我们已经目击过好几次处刑）|#0104Adv09_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（每次处刑时，这个底座会下降到地下，<br>　然后又升上来另一个不同的处刑台）|#0104Adv09_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然不太清楚具体构造，<br>　但这应该都是靠机械运作的吧）|#0104Adv09_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想起处刑时那阵齿轮互相碰撞的刺耳声音，<br>艾玛用力地甩了甩头。|#0104Adv09_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她再次看向亚里沙的模样，<br>泪水随即模糊了视野。|#0104Adv09_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果真的有人害亚里沙遭到这种不幸，<br>　我绝对不会原谅这个人）|#0104Adv09_Ema018|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，你还好吗……？|#0104Adv09_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露轻轻地把手搭在艾玛的肩膀上，<br>于是艾玛用袖口用力地擦了擦眼泪。|#0104Adv09_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我没事。我去其他地方调查。|#0104Adv09_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好的……请你千万不要勉强自己。|#0104Adv09_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，梅露露，谢谢你。|#0104Adv09_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走出了审判庭。|#0104Adv09_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

